{"root":{"data":{"id":"dm10b6eirk00","created":1791620071532,"text":"工作清单","font-size":32},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm10bul7vag0","created":1791620124179,"text":"2026.10","font-size":24,"priority":null,"expandState":"expand","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm10cmho20w0","created":1791620184915,"text":"紧急：\n1. USB20孔插排线路板方案选型\n2. USB插排线路板改板推进\n3. 仓库风扇板维修\n4. 三麦克风线路板推进（原理图、贴片焊接验证）","priority":1,"font-size":18,"layout":null,"background":"transparent"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm10c1ymag80","created":1791620140227,"text":"待办：\n\n1. ESP32-S3(2.8inch)开发板测试、检查核对，发给张工批量贴片\n2. ESP32三麦克风板原理图推理，贴片测试线路板\n3. ES8311/ES7210音频处理模块单独画板，对接ESP32-S3\n4. ESP32-S3(2.8inch)开发板更换LCD,驱动引脚重新定义\n5. LCD屏幕驱动板抄板，用于ESP32-S3(2.8inch)开发板\n6. 汽车蓝牙板改板（蓝牙音响、功放方案选型），对接ESP32-S3开发板\n7. 仓库风扇板维修\n8. ESP32-S3（2.8inch）开发板采购屏幕\n9. USB20孔插排新方案选型\n10. 空气炸锅线路板工作原理梳理","priority":2,"layout":null,"font-size":18,"expandState":"expand","background":"#ffff00","font-weight":"bold"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dma56afgilc0","created":1792547833634,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dma573154p40","created":1792547895895,"text":"10.23-1030","layout_right_offset":{"x":-69.1666639182306,"y":58.33333101537505}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dma56crukmg0","created":1792547838737,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dma56c4f7z40","created":1792547837320,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dma56cl7pts0","created":1792547838336,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm10cmxk2uo0","created":1791620185875,"text":"已完成：\n1. 广交会展品已测试打包\n2. USB-20孔插排线路板已测试打样，待测试第2版","priority":3,"font-size":18,"layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}